<block><txt break.before="1">An Act relating to civil proceedings by and
against the Crown; to repeal the <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Claims against the Government and
Crown Suits Act 1912</i></name></legref>; and for other
purposes.</txt></block></tier>
</content>


<content type="body">

<level type="clause" id="sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ef316d77-2328-4253-99c8-4770893c855d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_238132b3-a0cd-48b2-a96f-c73d1146ea91"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref jurisd="NSW"
type="act" check="unknown" refid="act-1988-070"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Crown
Proceedings Act 1988</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5165f1a5-8785-4909-a135-93fb237f5f06"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_62a6f75a-75e5-41c7-9fc7-1694c0065b30"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act commences on a day or days to be
appointed by proclamation.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_7f4b7fab-a260-450e-b174-39dddba630ab"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_3e4b8615-5d50-47b9-b66a-173021d0f477"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a226bb51-707d-4692-b7af-f2fc8e36296b"
id="def.civilproceedings"><b><i>civil proceedings</i></b></defterm> includes
civil proceedings at law or in equity, and also includes proceedings by way of
preliminary discovery, cross-claim, counterclaim, cross-action, set-off,
third-party claim and interpleader.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_af0868c0-f408-4a09-9162-bc9a7f08b5e0"
id="def.Crown"><b><i>Crown</i></b></defterm> means the Crown in right of New
South Wales, and includes:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_4b5809f9-c382-42bd-ab13-a631d20e5c22" id="sec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Government of New South Wales,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_25e3a965-5f0f-44fa-8256-07c8d89037a2" id="sec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a Minister of the Crown in right of New South
Wales, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_c62c6289-4fdc-4453-8e72-7327652e1ead" id="sec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a statutory corporation, or other body,
representing the Crown in right of New South Wales.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_56b78a1c-5d48-449e-accf-896e01738684"
id="def.judgment"><b><i>judgment</i></b></defterm> includes every species of
relief which a court can grant, whether interlocutory or final, and whether by
way of order that anything be done or not done or otherwise, and also includes
a declaration.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4ad3b881-28a5-4375-9838-cff934bd6050"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_49480523-e381-4ddd-8278-200159b558ad"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Crown may sue</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Crown may bring civil proceedings under the
title &#8220;State of New South Wales&#8221; against any person in any
competent court.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_25189242-963f-4fd1-afaa-c43b4eb34011"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_bdb0bea8-eda6-4ad7-840c-8e56c4f0ea3e"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Crown may be sued</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_94d52495-7ab4-4c82-9d28-4e426bd2fd9e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any person, having or deeming himself, herself or
itself to have any just claim or demand whatever against the Crown (not being
a claim or demand against a statutory corporation representing the Crown) may
bring civil proceedings against the Crown under the title &#8220;State of New
South Wales&#8221; in any competent court.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_29dcc30c-47cc-48e7-be11-195d3b66ce52"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Civil proceedings against the Crown shall be
commenced in the same way, and the proceedings and rights of the parties in
the case shall as nearly as possible be the same, and judgment and costs shall
follow or may be awarded on either side, and shall bear interest, as in an
ordinary case between subject and subject.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 5:</b> Am 1998 No 49,
Sch 9.</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_44d459b8-d3cc-4f4c-aee3-5c7247a44f8f"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_f465c6d2-e162-42dc-8404-71600ea0eecf"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Service of documents on the Crown</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cf7a59f7-c3ca-4744-ac0e-1a372ba41e13"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In connection with civil proceedings by or
against the Crown under the title &#8220;State of New South Wales&#8221; a
document required to be served on the Crown shall be served (subject to any
other Act or law) on the Crown Solicitor.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_38c745fc-c5bd-49c2-aab1-613fd2ed986a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Rules of court may be made with respect to the
mode of service of documents on the Crown Solicitor for the purposes of this
section, including rules that personal service may be duly effected by leaving
a document at the office of the Crown Solicitor.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_72198a60-f891-46df-a3de-9da78d1a6a8b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_214a7e58-7fff-4960-b57c-c26fdf98972e"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Satisfaction of judgment</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f86f8b61-e4f3-4bcd-b74c-396d1b9b7536"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Treasurer shall pay (out of any money legally
available) all money payable by the Crown under any judgment, including any
interest, except to the extent that the money is paid by some person other
than the Treasurer.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.7-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_5604fd3c-f986-4a6f-b602-d86bf2ebc8c5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Execution, attachment or similar process shall
not be issued out of any court against the Crown or any property of the
Crown.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c8a744b0-c437-4f30-b229-2cccb752f551"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_d9070dbd-5d4a-4300-be0c-87f8b7a91827"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Demise of the Crown</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cbfeb3bf-5c13-4d73-abc7-c343a362a2d3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">No proceedings (whether civil or criminal)
involving the Crown shall abate or be affected by the demise of the
Crown.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_744fe5c1-26c3-4151-ab9d-9cf8fcad2865"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">For the purposes of this section, <defterm
type="definition" guid="_4ecf7689-1c34-4c09-9044-8d52ea77adea"
id="sec.8-def.demise"><b><i>demise</i></b></defterm> includes a demise by or
on abdication.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0808c593-6730-416a-843d-b877574daeb7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_bdc6b099-6a4a-46cf-b4ae-3895b9034992"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Certain matters not affected</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_62b6614e-ca32-4808-992a-96c4d14bbdeb"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act (except for section 10) does not affect
any law, custom or procedure under which civil proceedings may be brought by
or against the Crown under any title.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ce13bf46-f6d9-4721-be47-f1da42975361"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Without limiting subsection (1), this Act does
not affect any law, custom or procedure under which the Attorney General is
entitled or liable to sue, or be sued, or to intervene in any proceedings on
behalf of the Crown, on the relation of, or on behalf of, any other person or
in any other capacity or for any other purpose whatever.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_06ca58b7-5a27-49a2-a692-7aeca5771aa9"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_42a3221d-52ee-4c7c-bde6-8aa18ab6280b"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Repeal of <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Claims against the Government and
Crown Suits Act 1912</i></name> No 27</legref></b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6c9ea232-7d40-4e54-ad06-12f401cdaa26"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Claims against the Government and
Crown Suits Act 1912</i></name></legref> is repealed.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_9106aeea-1e7c-4046-83df-e0bb2ef804d7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act affects proceedings commenced
before the commencement of this section, and the repealed Act continues to
apply in relation to any such proceedings as if this Act had not been
enacted.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


